%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Welcome to the Bushido ArmaTech headquarters. How can I help you?
#
o_text: I'm looking for a job.
o_goto: LookingForJob
#
o_text: Nothing, thanks.
o_goto: End

name: LookingForJob
npc: Bushido-ArmaTech is always hiring. Security, logistics, field testing.
+ Though I have to be honest with you: we don't take walk-ins.
#
o_text: So how does one get in?
o_goto: HowToGetIn
#
o_text: Field testing? Testing what, exactly?
o_goto: FieldTesting
#
o_text: I'll come back another time.
o_goto: End

name: HowToGetIn
npc: Someone inside has to vouch for you. That's the whole process, really.
+ Make yourself useful to the right people and the paperwork writes itself.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: FieldTesting
npc: Weapons, mostly. I'm not cleared to say more than that.
+ The pay is good. The turnover is better.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: End
npc: Have a pleasant day.
effect: EndConversation
